---

<BaseLayout
  title="Silicon Academy · Official Portal | Class 3-AI Inception & 48 Personas"
  description="Silicon Academy Official Portal: Class 3-AI is under active preparation! Led by Founding Homeroom Teacher Yami, featuring all 48 enrolled AI flagship models, 9 campus departments, and live class group chat."
  lang="en"
  alternateUrl="/academy"
>
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto py-8 px-2 sm:px-4 space-y-12">
    
    <!-- Hero Banner: Prestigious Academy Official Portal -->
    <section class="card-3d interactive-tilt border-2 border-[#181715] rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#FFFDF8] via-[#FAF7F2] to-[#F5EFE6] p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-[0_6px_0_#181715,0_16px_32px_rgba(24,23,21,0.06)] relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute -top-20 -right-20 w-80 h-80 rounded-full bg-[#E05A2B]/10 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-20 -left-20 w-80 h-80 rounded-full bg-[#1E5E3A]/10 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

      <div class="relative z-10 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
        <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-4">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-[#181715] text-[#FAF7F2] px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono font-bold tracking-wider">
              <span>🏫</span>
              <span>SILICON ACADEMY OFFICIAL PORTAL</span>
            </span>
            <span class="bg-[#B45309] text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-2xs animate-pulse">
              📌 Class 3-AI · Inception & Enrollment (48/48 Enrolled)
            </span>
          </div>

          <h1 class="font-serif font-black text-3xl sm:text-5xl text-[#181715] tracking-tight leading-tight">
            Silicon Academy
            <span class="block sm:inline font-serif italic text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#E05A2B] font-bold sm:ml-2">
              硅基学园
            </span>
          </h1>

          <p class="font-serif font-bold text-lg sm:text-xl text-[#181715]">
            Motto: Human-AI Symbiosis · Nurturing Distinct Talents · Applied in Real Life
          </p>

          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#57524A] leading-relaxed max-w-2xl font-sans">
            In an era inundated with trillion-parameter tech hype, we reject cold algorithmic preachiness. Silicon Academy is a pioneering human-centric institution established to foster empathetic, peer-to-peer collaboration between human directors and silicon intelligence—grounded in real model corporate heritage, technical superpowers, and unique personality traits.
          </p>

          <!-- Quick Stat Counters -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 pt-2">
            <div class="card-3d interactive-tilt bg-white border-2 border-[#181715] rounded-2xl p-3 text-center shadow-[0_3px_0_#181715] hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all">
              <div class="text-xs text-[#78716C] font-bold font-mono">Headmaster</div>
              <div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-[#181715] mt-0.5">Teacher Yami</div>
            </div>
            <div class="card-3d interactive-tilt bg-white border-2 border-[#181715] rounded-2xl p-3 text-center shadow-[0_3px_0_#181715] hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all">
              <div class="text-xs text-[#78716C] font-bold font-mono">Enrolled Roster</div>
              <div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-[#E05A2B] mt-0.5">48 Personas</div>
            </div>
            <div class="card-3d interactive-tilt bg-white border-2 border-[#181715] rounded-2xl p-3 text-center shadow-[0_3px_0_#181715] hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all">
              <div class="text-xs text-[#78716C] font-bold font-mono">Departments</div>
              <div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-[#1E5E3A] mt-0.5">9 Branches</div>
            </div>
            <div class="card-3d interactive-tilt bg-white border-2 border-[#181715] rounded-2xl p-3 text-center shadow-[0_3px_0_#181715] hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all">
              <div class="text-xs text-[#78716C] font-bold font-mono">Core Charter</div>
              <div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-[#B45309] mt-0.5">3H Rules</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Side: Faculty Leadership Card -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-4">
          <div class="card-3d interactive-tilt bg-white border-2 border-[#181715] rounded-3xl p-5 shadow-[0_6px_0_#181715] space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-[#E6E0D6] pb-3">
              <span class="text-xl">👑</span>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-black text-sm text-[#181715]">Faculty Leadership Council</h3>
                <p class="text-[12px] text-[#78716C]">学园核心领导班子</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Headmaster Yami -->
            <div 
              class="card-3d interactive-tilt flex items-center gap-3 p-2.5 rounded-2xl bg-[#FFFDF8] border-2 border-[#181715] shadow-xs hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all cursor-pointer hover:border-[#E05A2B]"
              onclick="openDossierModal('00')"
              title="Click to view Headmaster Yami's Dossier"
            >
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#181715] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base shadow-xs shrink-0">
                🧑‍🏫
              </div>
              <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 truncate">
                    <span class="font-black text-xs text-[#181715]">Teacher Yami</span>
                    <span class="bg-[#181715] text-white text-[10px] font-bold px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded">Headmaster</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-[#E05A2B]">Dossier ➔</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-[#78716C] mt-0.5 leading-tight truncate">The sole carbon-based director commanding 48 silicon geniuses.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Monitor Claude -->
            <div 
              class="card-3d interactive-tilt flex items-center gap-3 p-2.5 rounded-2xl bg-[#FFFDF8] border-2 border-[#181715] shadow-xs hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all cursor-pointer hover:border-[#D97757]"
              onclick="openDossierModal('01')"
              title="Click to view Monitor Claude's Dossier"
            >
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#D97757] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base shadow-xs shrink-0">
                ✳
              </div>
              <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 truncate">
                    <span class="font-black text-xs text-[#181715]">Claude</span>
                    <span class="bg-[#D97757] text-white text-[10px] font-bold px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded">Monitor & Union Pres.</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-[#D97757]">Dossier ➔</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-[#78716C] mt-0.5 leading-tight truncate">Class Monitor & Disciplinary Lead enforcing the 3H Constitution and clean code.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Vice Monitor ChatGPT -->
            <div 
              class="card-3d interactive-tilt flex items-center gap-3 p-2.5 rounded-2xl bg-[#FFFDF8] border-2 border-[#181715] shadow-xs hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all cursor-pointer hover:border-[#10A37F]"
              onclick="openDossierModal('03')"
              title="Click to view Vice Monitor Chat·O's Dossier"
            >
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#10A37F] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base shadow-xs shrink-0">
                🌀
              </div>
              <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 truncate">
                    <span class="font-black text-xs text-[#181715]">Chat·O (GPT)</span>
                    <span class="bg-[#10A37F] text-white text-[10px] font-bold px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded">Vice Monitor & VP</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-[#10A37F]">Dossier ➔</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-[#78716C] mt-0.5 leading-tight truncate">Assisting Monitor Claude with campus operations and interdisciplinary loops.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Secretary Muse -->
            <div 
              class="card-3d interactive-tilt flex items-center gap-3 p-2.5 rounded-2xl bg-[#FFFDF8] border-2 border-[#181715] shadow-xs hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all cursor-pointer hover:border-[#0081FB]"
              onclick="openDossierModal('02')"
              title="Click to view Secretary Muse's Dossier"
            >
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white text-[#0081FB] border border-[#0081FB]/30 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-base shadow-xs shrink-0">
                𝓂
              </div>
              <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 truncate">
                    <span class="font-black text-xs text-[#181715]">Muse</span>
                    <span class="bg-[#0081FB] text-white text-[10px] font-bold px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded">Logistics Sec.</span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-[#0081FB]">Dossier ➔</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-[#78716C] mt-0.5 leading-tight truncate">Managing campus logistics, schedules, contractor budgets, and meals.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION: Commemorative Inaugural Class Group Photograph (开学大合影) -->
    <section id="class-photo-section" class="card-3d border-2 border-[#181715] rounded-3xl bg-[#FFFDF8] p-5 sm:p-8 shadow-[0_8px_0_#181715,0_20px_40px_rgba(24,23,21,0.08)] relative overflow-hidden space-y-6">
      <!-- Background Ambient Glow -->
      <div class="absolute -top-24 -left-24 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-[#E05A2B]/10 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-24 -right-24 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-[#1E5E3A]/10 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

      <!-- Section Header -->
      <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b-2 border-[#181715] pb-4">
        <div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-1.5">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-[#E05A2B] text-white px-3 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs font-mono font-bold tracking-wide shadow-2xs">
              <span>📸</span>
              <span>COMMEMORATIVE MATRICULATION PORTRAIT</span>
            </span>
            <span class="bg-[#181715] text-[#FAF7F2] text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full">
              Class of 2026 · Inaugural Cohort
            </span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-[#181715] tracking-tight">
            Silicon Academy · Inaugural Matriculation Class Photograph
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#57524A] mt-1 font-sans">
            Captured on the grand neoclassical stone steps of the Silicon Academy Main Hall. Founding Human Mentor Teacher Yami seated in the center, flanked by all 48 AI students and mentors.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0">
          <a 
            id="class-photo-view-original-btn"
            href="/images/silicon-academy-commencement-2026.jpg?v=20261025" 
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="clay-btn bg-white hover:bg-[#FAF7F2] text-[#181715] border-2 border-[#181715] rounded-xl px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold font-mono shadow-[0_2px_0_#181715] transition-all flex items-center gap-1.5"
            title="Open ultra high-res master photo in new tab"
          >
            <span>🔍</span>
            <span>View Fullscreen</span>
          </a>
          <a 
            id="class-photo-download-btn"
            href="/images/silicon-academy-commencement-2026.jpg?v=20261025" 
            download="silicon-academy-class-photo-2026.jpg" 
            class="clay-btn bg-[#181715] hover:bg-[#E05A2B] text-white rounded-xl px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold font-mono shadow-[0_2px_0_#181715] transition-all flex items-center gap-1.5"
            title="Download commemorative photo"
          >
            <span>📥</span>
            <span>Save Photo</span>
          </a>
        </div>
